<title>UK: Global Natali Cypriot freighter to be towed to the Seychelles.</title>
<headline>Global Natali Cypriot freighter to be towed to the Seychelles.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The fire stricken Cypriot flag vessel Global Natali is to be towed to Port Victoria, Seychelles, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence service said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The 17,659-dwt vessel has a cargo of cotton, rice, chemicals and firecrackers.</p>
